+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>The 80/20 rule of Pandas:</strong> About 80% of real-world data work is <em>selecting the right rows and columns</em>. The remaining 20% is computation. If you master selection and filtering, you master the hardest part of practical data analysis.</div>'
