+ '<h2 class="l-title">4. String Methods \u2014 The .str Accessor</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">The <code>.str</code> accessor unlocks vectorized string operations on Series. Every Python string method has a Pandas equivalent that operates on the entire column at once \u2014 no loops needed. This is particularly important for <strong>NLP text preprocessing</strong>.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
