tr:

'<p class="l-text"><strong>Se\u00e7me ve filtreleme</strong>, bir DataFrame \u00fczerinde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirece\u011finiz en yayg\u0131n i\u015flemlerdir. Tek bir s\u00fctuna, sat\u0131rlar\u0131n bir alt k\u00fcmesine veya karma\u015f\u0131k bir boolean sorguya ihtiyac\u0131n\u0131z olsun, Pandas zengin bir ara\u00e7 seti sunar. <code>.loc</code>, <code>.iloc</code>, boolean indeksleme ve string metotlar\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenmek sizi her veri analizi g\u00f6revinde \u00e7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131 yapacakt\u0131r.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>Pandas\'ta 80/20 kural\u0131:</strong> Ger\u00e7ek d\u00fcnya veri \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131n yakla\u015f\u0131k %80\'i <em>do\u011fru sat\u0131r ve s\u00fctunlar\u0131 se\u00e7mektir</em>. Kalan %20\'si hesaplamad\u0131r. Se\u00e7me ve filtrelemeyi ustala\u015f\u0131rsan\u0131z, pratik veri analizinin en zor k\u0131sm\u0131n\u0131 ustala\u015f\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z.</div>'
+ '<div class="lesson-outcomes" style="background:rgba(200,169,110,0.06);border-left:3px solid #c8a96e;padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0"><div style="font-size:0.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#c8a96e;margin-bottom:0.6rem">📍 BU DERSTE ÖĞRENECEKSİN</div><ul style="margin:0;padding-left:1.3rem;line-height:1.65;font-size:0.93rem;color:rgba(235,230,220,0.92)"><li>.loc ile etikete göre, .iloc ile konuma göre satır ve sütun seç</li><li>Çoklu koşullu filtreleme için & ve | ile boolean maskeleri birleştir</li><li>İfadeli filtreler için .isin(), .between() ve string metodlarını kullan</li><li>DataFrame.query() ile okunabilir filtre pipeline\'ları yaz</li><li>Bir veya birden çok sütuna göre veriyi sırala ve rank\'la</li><li>Filtrelenmiş alt kümelere atama yaparken SettingWithCopyWarning\'den kaçın</li></ul></div>'


/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 1: S\u00fctun Se\u00e7imi
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">1. S\u00fctun Se\u00e7imi</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">S\u00fctun se\u00e7mek en temel i\u015flemdir. Bir DataFrame\'den bir veya birden fazla s\u00fctun almak i\u00e7in farkl\u0131 avantaj ve dezavantajlara sahip birden fazla yol vard\u0131r.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">df["s\u00fctun"]</div><div class="card-body">K\u00f6\u015feli parantez. Series d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Bo\u015fluk ve \u00f6zel karakterler dahil her s\u00fctun ad\u0131yla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. <strong>Her zaman tercih edilir.</strong></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">df.sutun</div><div class="card-body">Nokta notasyonu. Series d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr. Sadece ge\u00e7erli Python tan\u0131mlay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 olan s\u00fctun adlar\u0131yla \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r (bo\u015fluk yok, metot \u00e7ak\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 yok).</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">df[["a","b"]]</div><div class="card-body">\u00c7ift parantez. <strong>DataFrame</strong> d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr (Series de\u011fil). Birden fazla s\u00fctun se\u00e7mek i\u00e7in s\u00fctun adlar\u0131 listesi ge\u00e7irin.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">df.filter()</div><div class="card-body">Regex veya alt dize s\u00fctun se\u00e7imi. Adland\u0131rma kal\u0131b\u0131 olan \u00e7ok say\u0131da s\u00fctununuz oldu\u011funda m\u00fckemmeldir (orn. "score_" ile ba\u015flayan t\u00fcm s\u00fctunlar).</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yas"</span>: [<span class="num">25</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">28</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">22</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan_mat"</span>: [<span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">91</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan_nlp"</span>: [<span class="num">92</span>, <span class="num">85</span>, <span class="num">78</span>, <span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">96</span>],\n    <span class="str">"alan"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"RL"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Tek s\u00fctun \u2192 Series</span>\nisimler = df[<span class="str">"isim"</span>]        <span class="cm"># \u2190 tercih edilen</span>\nisimler = df.isim            <span class="cm"># ayn\u0131 sonu\u00e7, ama k\u0131r\u0131lgan</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">type</span>(isimler))        <span class="cm"># &lt;class \'pandas.core.series.Series\'&gt;</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Birden fazla s\u00fctun \u2192 DataFrame</span>\nalt_kume = df[[<span class="str">"isim"</span>, <span class="str">"yas"</span>]]   <span class="cm"># \u00e7ift paranteze dikkat</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="fn">type</span>(alt_kume))            <span class="cm"># &lt;class \'pandas.core.frame.DataFrame\'&gt;</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># filter() ile regex s\u00fctun se\u00e7imi</span>\npuan_cols = df.<span class="fn">filter</span>(regex=<span class="str">"^puan_"</span>)  <span class="cm"># \'puan_\' ile ba\u015flayan s\u00fctunlar</span>\n<span class="fn">print</span>(puan_cols.columns)  <span class="cm"># Index([\'puan_mat\', \'puan_nlp\'])</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># alt dize (like=) veya tam \u00f6\u011fe ile filtreleme</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">filter</span>(like=<span class="str">"puan"</span>)          <span class="cm"># \'puan\' i\u00e7eren s\u00fctunlar</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">filter</span>(items=[<span class="str">"isim"</span>,<span class="str">"yas"</span>])  <span class="cm"># kesin s\u00fctun adlar\u0131</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>df["s\u00fctun"] vs df.sutun:</strong> Her zaman k\u00f6\u015feli parantez notasyonu <code>df["s\u00fctun"]</code> kullan\u0131n. Nokta notasyonu <code>df.sutun</code>, s\u00fctun adlar\u0131 bo\u015fluk i\u00e7erdi\u011finde, say\u0131yla ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya DataFrame metotlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6lgeledi\u011finde ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olur (orn. <code>df.count</code> metodu \u00e7a\u011f\u0131r\u0131r, s\u00fctunu de\u011fil). K\u00f6\u015feli parantezlerde bu sorun hi\u00e7 olmaz.</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">SERIES D\u00d6ND\u00dcR\u00dcR</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df["isim"] <em>parantezde tek dize</em></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df.isim <em>nokta notasyonu</em></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df.loc[:, "isim"] <em>loc ile tek etiket</em></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df.iloc[:, 0] <em>iloc ile tek int</em></div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">DATAFRAME D\u00d6ND\u00dcR\u00dcR</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df[["isim"]] <em>parantezde liste</em></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df[["isim","yas"]] <em>\u00e7ok s\u00fctunlu liste</em></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df.loc[:, ["isim"]] <em>loc ile liste</em></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df.filter(like="puan") <em>filter metodu</em></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 2: Sat\u0131r Se\u00e7imi
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">2. Sat\u0131r Se\u00e7imi \u2014 .loc vs .iloc</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Pandas sat\u0131r se\u00e7imi i\u00e7in iki birincil indeksleyici sa\u011flar: <strong>etiket tabanl\u0131</strong> eri\u015fim i\u00e7in <code>.loc</code> ve <strong>tam say\u0131 konum tabanl\u0131</strong> eri\u015fim i\u00e7in <code>.iloc</code>. Aradaki fark\u0131 anlamak kritiktir \u2014 bunlar\u0131 kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131rmak en yayg\u0131n Pandas hatalar\u0131ndan biridir.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">.loc (Etiket Tabanl\u0131)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item"><strong>\u0130ndeks etiketlerini</strong> kullan\u0131r (dize, tarih vb.)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Dilim sonu <strong>dahildir</strong></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df.loc["a":"c"] "c"yi i\u00e7erir</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">En iyi: adl\u0131 indeksler, tarih aral\u0131klar\u0131</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Eksik etikette KeyError f\u0131rlat\u0131r</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">.iloc (Tam Say\u0131 Konumu)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item"><strong>Tam say\u0131 konumlar\u0131n\u0131</strong> kullan\u0131r (0, 1, 2...)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Dilim sonu <strong>hari\u00e7tir</strong></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">df.iloc[0:3] konum 3\'\u00fc hari\u00e7 tutar</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">En iyi: ilk N sat\u0131r, son N sat\u0131r</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Aral\u0131k d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda IndexError f\u0131rlat\u0131r</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yas"</span>: [<span class="num">25</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">28</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">22</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan"</span>: [<span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">91</span>]\n}, index=[<span class="str">"s1"</span>, <span class="str">"s2"</span>, <span class="str">"s3"</span>, <span class="str">"s4"</span>, <span class="str">"s5"</span>])\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- .loc: etiket tabanl\u0131 ----</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">loc</span>[<span class="str">"s1"</span>]                 <span class="cm"># tek sat\u0131r (Series olarak)</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">loc</span>[[<span class="str">"s1"</span>, <span class="str">"s3"</span>]]          <span class="cm"># birden fazla sat\u0131r (DataFrame)</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">loc</span>[<span class="str">"s1"</span>:<span class="str">"s3"</span>]             <span class="cm"># dilim: s1, s2, s3 (dahil!)</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">loc</span>[<span class="str">"s2"</span>, <span class="str">"isim"</span>]         <span class="cm"># tek de\u011fer: \'Bob\'</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">loc</span>[<span class="str">"s1"</span>:<span class="str">"s3"</span>, [<span class="str">"isim"</span>, <span class="str">"puan"</span>]]  <span class="cm"># sat\u0131r + s\u00fctun</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- .iloc: tam say\u0131 konumu ----</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">iloc</span>[<span class="num">0</span>]                    <span class="cm"># ilk sat\u0131r (Series olarak)</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">iloc</span>[[<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">2</span>]]               <span class="cm"># 0 ve 2 konumlar\u0131ndaki sat\u0131rlar</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">iloc</span>[<span class="num">0</span>:<span class="num">3</span>]                  <span class="cm"># ilk 3 sat\u0131r (son hari\u00e7!)</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">iloc</span>[<span class="num">1</span>, <span class="num">0</span>]                <span class="cm"># sat\u0131r 1, s\u00fctun 0: \'Bob\'</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">iloc</span>[<span class="num">0</span>:<span class="num">3</span>, [<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">2</span>]]         <span class="cm"># ilk 3 sat\u0131r, 0 ve 2 s\u00fctunlar\u0131</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># ---- .at / .iat: h\u0131zl\u0131 skaler eri\u015fim ----</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">at</span>[<span class="str">"s1"</span>, <span class="str">"isim"</span>]          <span class="cm"># \'Alice\' (etiket tabanl\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131)</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">iat</span>[<span class="num">0</span>, <span class="num">0</span>]                  <span class="cm"># \'Alice\' (tam say\u0131 tabanl\u0131, h\u0131zl\u0131)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># .at/.iat tek de\u011ferler i\u00e7in .loc/.iloc\'dan ~10x daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r</span>\n<span class="cm"># D\u00f6ng\u00fclerde tek h\u00fccrelere eri\u015fmeniz gerekti\u011finde bunlar\u0131 kullan\u0131n</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Etiket veya isim mi laz\u0131m?</div><div class="step-detail">Etiket tabanl\u0131 se\u00e7im i\u00e7in <code>.loc</code> kullan\u0131n. Dize indeksleri, tarih indeksleri ve boolean maskelerle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Dilim u\u00e7 noktalar\u0131 <strong>dahildir</strong>.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Konum mu laz\u0131m?</div><div class="step-detail">Tam say\u0131 konum tabanl\u0131 se\u00e7im i\u00e7in <code>.iloc</code> kullan\u0131n. Python liste indeksleme gibi \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Dilim u\u00e7 noktalar\u0131 <strong>hari\u00e7tir</strong>.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">H\u0131zl\u0131 tek de\u011fer mi laz\u0131m?</div><div class="step-detail">Skaler eri\u015fim i\u00e7in <code>.at</code> (etiket) veya <code>.iat</code> (tam say\u0131) kullan\u0131n. Bireysel h\u00fccreler i\u00e7in loc/iloc\'dan ~10x daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r. D\u00f6ng\u00fclerde \u015fart.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="think-box"><strong>D\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn:</strong> Neden <code>.loc["a":"c"]</code> "c"\u2019yi dahil eder ama <code>.iloc[0:3]</code> konum 3\'\u00fc hari\u00e7 tutar? Etiket tabanl\u0131 dilimleme dahildir \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc etiketler s\u0131ral\u0131 tam say\u0131lar de\u011fildir \u2014 "c"den sonra hari\u00e7 u\u00e7 noktas\u0131 olarak kullan\u0131lacak bir "sonraki" etiket yoktur. Bu, isim veya tarih aral\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnme \u015feklinize uygundur.</div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 3: Boolean Filtreleme
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">3. Boolean Filtreleme</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><strong>Boolean indeksleme</strong>, sat\u0131rlar\u0131 filtrelemenin en g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc yoludur. Her sat\u0131r i\u00e7in bir boolean Series (True/False) olu\u015fturursunuz ve yaln\u0131zca ko\u015fulun True oldu\u011fu sat\u0131rlar\u0131 se\u00e7mek i\u00e7in kullan\u0131rs\u0131n\u0131z. Bu, SQL\'deki WHERE c\u00fcmlesine benzer.</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>, <span class="str">"Frank"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yas"</span>: [<span class="num">25</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">28</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">22</span>, <span class="num">40</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan"</span>: [<span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">91</span>, <span class="num">85</span>],\n    <span class="str">"alan"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"RL"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Tek ko\u015ful</span>\nyuksek_puan = df[df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>] > <span class="num">85</span>]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(yuksek_puan)\n<span class="cm">#     isim  yas  puan alan</span>\n<span class="cm"># 0  Alice   25    88  NLP</span>\n<span class="cm"># 2  Carol   28    95   RL</span>\n<span class="cm"># 4    Eve   22    91   CV</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Birden fazla ko\u015ful: & | ~ ve parantez ZORUNLU!</span>\nsonuc = df[(df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>] > <span class="num">80</span>) & (df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>] < <span class="num">30</span>)]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(sonuc)\n<span class="cm">#     isim  yas  puan alan</span>\n<span class="cm"># 0  Alice   25    88  NLP</span>\n<span class="cm"># 4    Eve   22    91   CV</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># VEYA ko\u015fulu</span>\nnlp_veya_cv = df[(df[<span class="str">"alan"</span>] == <span class="str">"NLP"</span>) | (df[<span class="str">"alan"</span>] == <span class="str">"CV"</span>)]\n\n<span class="cm"># DE\u011e\u0130L ko\u015fulu</span>\nnlp_degil = df[~(df[<span class="str">"alan"</span>] == <span class="str">"NLP"</span>)]\n\n<span class="cm"># .isin() \u2014 zincirlemi\u015f OR\'dan daha temiz</span>\nnlp_cv = df[df[<span class="str">"alan"</span>].<span class="fn">isin</span>([<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>])]\n\n<span class="cm"># .between() \u2014 aral\u0131k filtresi (varsay\u0131lan dahil)</span>\norta_yas = df[df[<span class="str">"yas"</span>].<span class="fn">between</span>(<span class="num">25</span>, <span class="num">35</span>)]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(orta_yas[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].tolist())  <span class="cm"># [\'Alice\', \'Bob\', \'Carol\', \'Dave\']</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="l-note"><strong>Yayg\u0131n hata:</strong> <code>&amp;</code>, <code>|</code>, <code>~</code> yerine <code>and</code>, <code>or</code>, <code>not</code> kullanmak ValueError f\u0131rlat\u0131r. Python\'un <code>and</code>/<code>or</code> operat\u00f6rleri tek boolean de\u011ferlerle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r, ancak Pandas boolean Series\'leri eleman baz\u0131nda operat\u00f6rlere ihtiya\u00e7 duyar. Ayr\u0131ca, operat\u00f6r \u00f6nceli\u011fi nedeniyle <strong>her ko\u015fulu parantez i\u00e7ine al\u0131n</strong>.</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># .query() \u2014 SQL benzeri filtreleme s\u00f6zdizimi</span>\n<span class="cm"># Karma\u015f\u0131k ko\u015fullar i\u00e7in daha okunabilir</span>\n\nsonuc = df.<span class="fn">query</span>(<span class="str">"puan > 80 and yas < 30"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(sonuc)\n\n<span class="cm"># De\u011fi\u015fkenler @ ile</span>\nmin_puan = <span class="num">85</span>\nsonuc = df.<span class="fn">query</span>(<span class="str">"puan >= @min_puan"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># query\'de dize kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rma</span>\nsonuc = df.<span class="fn">query</span>(<span class="str">"alan == \'NLP\'"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Olumsuzlama</span>\nsonuc = df.<span class="fn">query</span>(<span class="str">"alan != \'NLP\' and puan > 70"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># .query() b\u00fcy\u00fck DataFrame\'lerde de daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc</span>\n<span class="cm"># ara boolean diziler olu\u015fturmaktan ka\u00e7\u0131n\u0131r</span></code></pre></div>'

/* --- Plotly: Filtered vs Unfiltered Scatter (TR) --- */
