+ 'Plotly.newPlot("plot-filter-tr",[t1,t2],layout,{responsive:true,displayModeBar:false});'
+ '},200)</script>'

+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> Eylemde boolean filtreleme. Ye\u015fil noktalar her iki ko\u015fulu da sa\u011flar (puan > 80 VE ya\u015f < 35). Kesikli \u00e7izgiler filtre s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131n\u0131 g\u00f6sterir. Ye\u015fil b\u00f6lgenin d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaki noktalar filtrelenir.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 4: String Metotlar\u0131
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">4. String Metotlar\u0131 \u2014 .str Eri\u015fimcisi</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text"><code>.str</code> eri\u015fimcisi, Series \u00fczerinde vekt\u00f6rize string i\u015flemlerini a\u00e7ar. Her Python string metodunun, t\u00fcm s\u00fctun \u00fczerinde ayn\u0131 anda \u00e7al\u0131\u015fan bir Pandas kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 vard\u0131r \u2014 d\u00f6ng\u00fc gerekmez. Bu \u00f6zellikle <strong>NLP metin \u00f6ni\u015fleme</strong> i\u00e7in \u00f6nemlidir.</p>'

+ '<div class="calc-cards">'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">B\u00fcy\u00fck/K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck Harf</div><div class="card-body">.str.lower(), .str.upper(), .str.title(), .str.capitalize(), .str.swapcase()</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u0130\u00e7erir/E\u015fle\u015fir</div><div class="card-body">.str.contains(), .str.startswith(), .str.endswith(), .str.match() \u2014 filtreleme i\u00e7in boolean maskeleri d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr.</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">D\u00f6n\u00fc\u015ft\u00fcrme</div><div class="card-body">.str.replace(), .str.strip(), .str.split(), .str.slice(), .str.pad(), .str.zfill()</div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-card"><div class="card-title">\u00c7\u0131karma</div><div class="card-body">.str.extract() ile regex gruplar\u0131, .str.findall(), .str.len(), .str.count() metin madencili\u011fi i\u00e7in.</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"metin"</span>: [\n        <span class="str">"Do\u011fal Dil \u0130\u015fleme \u00e7ok e\u011flenceli!"</span>,\n        <span class="str">"Derin \u00d6\u011frenme ve PyTorch"</span>,\n        <span class="str">"  duygu analizi  "</span>,\n        <span class="str">"NER: Varl\u0131k Ad\u0131 Tan\u0131ma"</span>,\n        <span class="str">"NLP g\u00f6revleri i\u00e7in transformer\'lar"</span>\n    ],\n    <span class="str">"etiket"</span>: [<span class="str">"poz"</span>, <span class="str">"poz"</span>, <span class="str">"neg"</span>, <span class="str">"poz"</span>, <span class="str">"neg"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># B\u00fcy\u00fck/k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harf d\u00f6n\u00fc\u015f\u00fcm\u00fc</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"kucuk"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">lower</span>()\ndf[<span class="str">"buyuk"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">upper</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># Contains (boolean maske d\u00f6nd\u00fcr\u00fcr)</span>\nnlp_satirlar = df[df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">contains</span>(<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, case=<span class="kw">False</span>)]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(nlp_satirlar[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].tolist())\n<span class="cm"># [\'Do\u011fal Dil \u0130\u015fleme \u00e7ok e\u011flenceli!\',</span>\n<span class="cm">#  \'NLP g\u00f6revleri i\u00e7in transformer\\\'lar\']</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># contains\'da Regex</span>\ndf[df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">contains</span>(<span class="str">r"\\bN[A-Z]{2}\\b"</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>)]  <span class="cm"># NLP, NER</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># startswith / endswith</span>\ndf[df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">startswith</span>(<span class="str">"Derin"</span>)]\ndf[df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">endswith</span>(<span class="str">"!"</span>)]\n\n<span class="cm"># Bo\u015fluk temizleme (ger\u00e7ek veri i\u00e7in kritik!)</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"temiz"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">strip</span>()\n\n<span class="cm"># B\u00f6l ve geni\u015flet</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"kelimeler"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">split</span>()           <span class="cm"># kelime listesi</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"kelime_say"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">split</span>().str.<span class="fn">len</span>()  <span class="cm"># kelime say\u0131s\u0131</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Regex ile de\u011fi\u015ftirme</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"noktalama_yok"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">r"[^\\w\\s]"</span>, <span class="str">""</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Dize uzunlu\u011fu</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"karakter_say"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"metin"</span>].str.<span class="fn">len</span>()</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># .str.extract() \u2014 yap\u0131land\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f \u00e7\u0131karma i\u00e7in regex gruplar\u0131</span>\n\nepostalar = pd.<span class="fn">Series</span>([<span class="str">"alice@mit.edu"</span>, <span class="str">"bob@google.com"</span>, <span class="str">"carol@nyu.edu"</span>])\n\n<span class="cm"># Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131 ve alan ad\u0131n\u0131 \u00e7\u0131kar</span>\ncikartilan = epostalar.str.<span class="fn">extract</span>(<span class="str">r"(\\w+)@(\\w+)\\.(\\w+)"</span>)\ncikartilan.columns = [<span class="str">"kullanici"</span>, <span class="str">"kurum"</span>, <span class="str">"uzanti"</span>]\n<span class="fn">print</span>(cikartilan)\n<span class="cm">#   kullanici   kurum uzanti</span>\n<span class="cm"># 0     alice     mit    edu</span>\n<span class="cm"># 1       bob  google    com</span>\n<span class="cm"># 2     carol     nyu    edu</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># .str ile NLP \u00d6ni\u015fleme Hatt\u0131</span>\nmetinler = pd.<span class="fn">Series</span>([<span class="str">"  Merhaba D\u00dcNYA!  "</span>, <span class="str">"NLP harikad\u0131r."</span>, <span class="str">"Derin-\u00d6\u011frenme 101"</span>])\ntemiz = (metinler\n    .str.<span class="fn">strip</span>()                              <span class="cm"># bo\u015fluklar\u0131 kald\u0131r</span>\n    .str.<span class="fn">lower</span>()                              <span class="cm"># k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck harfe \u00e7evir</span>\n    .str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">r"[^a-z\u00e7\u011f\u0131\u00f6\u015f\u00fc\\s]"</span>, <span class="str">""</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>)  <span class="cm"># harf d\u0131\u015f\u0131 kald\u0131r</span>\n    .str.<span class="fn">replace</span>(<span class="str">r"\\s+"</span>, <span class="str">" "</span>, regex=<span class="kw">True</span>)      <span class="cm"># bo\u015fluklar\u0131 normalize et</span>\n)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(temiz.tolist())\n<span class="cm"># [\'merhaba d\u00fcnya\', \'nlp harikad\u0131r\', \'derin\u00f6\u011frenme \']</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-highlight"><strong>NLP ipucu:</strong> <code>.str</code> eri\u015fimcisi, \u00f6l\u00e7ekte metin \u00f6ni\u015fleme i\u00e7in en iyi arkada\u015f\u0131n\u0131zd\u0131r. <code>.str.lower()</code> \u2192 <code>.str.replace()</code> \u2192 <code>.str.split()</code> hatt\u0131, milyonlarca metin \u00f6rne\u011fini saniyeler i\u00e7inde temizleyebilir \u2014 <code>.apply()</code> ile sat\u0131r sat\u0131r Python fonksiyonlar\u0131 uygulamaktan \u00e7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131d\u0131r.</div>'

/* --- Plotly: Word Count Distribution (TR) --- */
+ '<div id="plot-strlen-tr" class="plotly-graph"></div>'
+ '<script>setTimeout(function(){'
+ 'var lens=[3,4,4,5,5,5,6,6,6,6,7,7,7,7,7,8,8,8,8,9,9,9,10,10,11,12];'
