+ '<div class="calc-graph"><div class="graph-caption"><strong>Bu grafik ne g\u00f6steriyor:</strong> Metin \u00f6ni\u015flemeden sonra token uzunluklar\u0131n\u0131n da\u011f\u0131l\u0131m\u0131. Token uzunluklar\u0131n\u0131 anlamak, NLP modellerinde tokenizer\'lar i\u00e7in uygun max_length parametrelerini se\u00e7meye yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur. \u00c7o\u011fu \u0130ngilizce kelime 4\u20138 karakter uzunlu\u011fundad\u0131r.</div></div>'

/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 5: S\u0131ralama ve Derecelendirme
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">5. S\u0131ralama &amp; Derecelendirme</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">S\u0131ralama, sat\u0131rlar\u0131 bir veya birden fazla s\u00fctuna g\u00f6re yeniden d\u00fczenlemenizi sa\u011flar. <code>sort_values()</code> s\u00fctun de\u011ferlerine g\u00f6re s\u0131ralar, <code>sort_index()</code> indekse g\u00f6re s\u0131ralar. <code>rank()</code> de\u011ferlere s\u0131ra veya istatistiksel derece atar.</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>, <span class="str">"Frank"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yas"</span>: [<span class="num">25</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">28</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">22</span>, <span class="num">40</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan"</span>: [<span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">91</span>, <span class="num">85</span>],\n    <span class="str">"alan"</span>: [<span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"RL"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>, <span class="str">"CV"</span>, <span class="str">"NLP"</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Tek s\u00fctuna g\u00f6re s\u0131rala</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">sort_values</span>(<span class="str">"puan"</span>, ascending=<span class="kw">False</span>)\n<span class="cm">#     isim  yas  puan alan</span>\n<span class="cm"># 2  Carol   28    95   RL</span>\n<span class="cm"># 4    Eve   22    91   CV</span>\n<span class="cm"># 0  Alice   25    88  NLP</span>\n<span class="cm"># 5  Frank   40    85  NLP</span>\n<span class="cm"># 1    Bob   30    72   CV</span>\n<span class="cm"># 3   Dave   35    60  NLP</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># \u00c7ok s\u00fctunlu s\u0131ralama: \u00f6nce alana, sonra puana g\u00f6re azalan</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">sort_values</span>([<span class="str">"alan"</span>, <span class="str">"puan"</span>], ascending=[<span class="kw">True</span>, <span class="kw">False</span>])\n\n<span class="cm"># \u0130ndekse g\u00f6re s\u0131rala</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">sort_index</span>(ascending=<span class="kw">False</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># nlargest / nsmallest \u2014 sort + head\'den daha h\u0131zl\u0131</span>\nen_iyi3 = df.<span class="fn">nlargest</span>(<span class="num">3</span>, <span class="str">"puan"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(en_iyi3[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].tolist())  <span class="cm"># [\'Carol\', \'Eve\', \'Alice\']</span>\n\nen_kucuk2 = df.<span class="fn">nsmallest</span>(<span class="num">2</span>, <span class="str">"yas"</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(en_kucuk2[<span class="str">"isim"</span>].tolist())  <span class="cm"># [\'Eve\', \'Alice\']</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># Derecelendirme y\u00f6ntemleri</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"sira_varsayilan"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">rank</span>(ascending=<span class="kw">False</span>)  <span class="cm"># e\u015fitliklerde ortalama</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"sira_min"</span>]       = df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">rank</span>(method=<span class="str">"min"</span>, ascending=<span class="kw">False</span>)\ndf[<span class="str">"sira_yogun"</span>]     = df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">rank</span>(method=<span class="str">"dense"</span>, ascending=<span class="kw">False</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># S\u0131ra y\u00f6ntemleri:</span>\n<span class="cm">#   \'average\' \u2014 e\u015fit de\u011ferler ortalama s\u0131ra al\u0131r (varsay\u0131lan)</span>\n<span class="cm">#   \'min\'     \u2014 e\u015fit de\u011ferler en d\u00fc\u015f\u00fck s\u0131ra al\u0131r (1224 tarz\u0131)</span>\n<span class="cm">#   \'max\'     \u2014 e\u015fit de\u011ferler en y\u00fcksek s\u0131ra al\u0131r</span>\n<span class="cm">#   \'first\'   \u2014 e\u015fit de\u011ferler verideki konumuna g\u00f6re s\u0131ralan\u0131r</span>\n<span class="cm">#   \'dense\'   \u2014 min gibi ama bo\u015fluksuz (1223 tarz\u0131)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Y\u00fczdelik s\u0131ra</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"yuzdelik"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">rank</span>(pct=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n<span class="fn">print</span>(df[[<span class="str">"isim"</span>,<span class="str">"puan"</span>,<span class="str">"yuzdelik"</span>]])\n<span class="cm">#     isim  puan   yuzdelik</span>\n<span class="cm"># 0  Alice    88  0.666667</span>\n<span class="cm"># 1    Bob    72  0.333333</span>\n<span class="cm"># 2  Carol    95  1.000000</span>\n<span class="cm"># 3   Dave    60  0.166667</span>\n<span class="cm"># 4    Eve    91  0.833333</span>\n<span class="cm"># 5  Frank    85  0.500000</span></code></pre></div>'

