/* ============================================================
   B\u00d6L\u00dcM 6: Geli\u015fmi\u015f Se\u00e7im
   ============================================================ */
+ '<h2 class="l-title">6. Geli\u015fmi\u015f Se\u00e7im &amp; Performans</h2>'

+ '<p class="l-text">Temel indeksleminin \u00f6tesinde, Pandas ko\u015fullu de\u011fi\u015ftirme, rastgele \u00f6rnekleme, metot zincirleme ve y\u00fcksek performansl\u0131 de\u011ferlendirme i\u00e7in \u00f6zel se\u00e7im ara\u00e7lar\u0131 sa\u011flar.</p>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="kw">import</span> pandas <span class="kw">as</span> pd\n<span class="kw">import</span> numpy <span class="kw">as</span> np\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"isim"</span>: [<span class="str">"Alice"</span>, <span class="str">"Bob"</span>, <span class="str">"Carol"</span>, <span class="str">"Dave"</span>, <span class="str">"Eve"</span>],\n    <span class="str">"puan"</span>: [<span class="num">88</span>, <span class="num">72</span>, <span class="num">95</span>, <span class="num">60</span>, <span class="num">91</span>],\n    <span class="str">"yas"</span>: [<span class="num">25</span>, <span class="num">30</span>, <span class="num">28</span>, <span class="num">35</span>, <span class="num">22</span>]\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># where() \u2014 ko\u015ful True olan de\u011ferleri tut, gerisi de\u011fi\u015ftir</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">where</span>(df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>] > <span class="num">80</span>, other=<span class="str">"KALDI"</span>)\n<span class="cm"># 0       88</span>\n<span class="cm"># 1    KALDI</span>\n<span class="cm"># 2       95</span>\n<span class="cm"># 3    KALDI</span>\n<span class="cm"># 4       91</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># mask() \u2014 where\'un tersi (True olan de\u011ferleri de\u011fi\u015ftir)</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">mask</span>(df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>] < <span class="num">80</span>, other=<span class="num">0</span>)\n<span class="cm"># 0    88</span>\n<span class="cm"># 1     0</span>\n<span class="cm"># 2    95</span>\n<span class="cm"># 3     0</span>\n<span class="cm"># 4    91</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># clip() \u2014 de\u011ferleri bir aral\u0131\u011fa s\u0131n\u0131rla</span>\ndf[<span class="str">"puan_sinirli"</span>] = df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>].<span class="fn">clip</span>(lower=<span class="num">70</span>, upper=<span class="num">90</span>)\n<span class="cm"># [88, 72, 90, 70, 90]  \u2192 de\u011ferler [70, 90] aras\u0131na s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131</span></code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-compare">'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">where(ko\u015ful)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Ko\u015ful <strong>True</strong> olan de\u011ferleri tut</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Ko\u015ful <strong>False</strong> olanlar\u0131 de\u011fi\u015ftir</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">SQL gibi: CASE WHEN ko\u015ful THEN de\u011fer</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">\u015eekli korur, "k\u00f6t\u00fc" de\u011ferleri de\u011fi\u015ftirir</div></div>'
+ '<div class="compare-col"><div class="compare-title">mask(ko\u015ful)</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Ko\u015ful <strong>True</strong> olan de\u011ferleri de\u011fi\u015ftir</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Ko\u015ful <strong>False</strong> olanlar\u0131 tut</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">where() ile ters mant\u0131k</div>'
+ '<div class="compare-item">Ayn\u0131 sonu\u00e7, ters ko\u015ful</div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># sample() \u2014 rastgele sat\u0131r \u00f6rnekleme</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">sample</span>(n=<span class="num">3</span>)                  <span class="cm"># 3 rastgele sat\u0131r</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">sample</span>(frac=<span class="num">0.5</span>)              <span class="cm"># sat\u0131rlar\u0131n %50\'si</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">sample</span>(n=<span class="num">3</span>, random_state=<span class="num">42</span>)  <span class="cm"># tekrarlanabilir rastgele</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">sample</span>(n=<span class="num">10</span>, replace=<span class="kw">True</span>)    <span class="cm"># bootstrap \u00f6rnekleme (yerine koymal\u0131)</span>\n\n<span class="cm"># Tabakal\u0131 \u00f6rnekleme (grup ba\u015f\u0131na e\u015fit)</span>\norneklem = df.<span class="fn">groupby</span>(<span class="str">"alan"</span>).<span class="fn">sample</span>(n=<span class="num">1</span>, random_state=<span class="num">42</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># pipe() \u2014 \u00f6zel fonksiyonlarla metot zincirleme</span>\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">not_ekle</span>(df):\n    df[<span class="str">"not"</span>] = pd.<span class="fn">cut</span>(df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>], bins=[<span class="num">0</span>,<span class="num">60</span>,<span class="num">70</span>,<span class="num">80</span>,<span class="num">90</span>,<span class="num">100</span>],\n                       labels=[<span class="str">"F"</span>,<span class="str">"D"</span>,<span class="str">"C"</span>,<span class="str">"B"</span>,<span class="str">"A"</span>])\n    <span class="kw">return</span> df\n\n<span class="kw">def</span> <span class="fn">gecenleri_filtrele</span>(df, min_puan=<span class="num">70</span>):\n    <span class="kw">return</span> df[df[<span class="str">"puan"</span>] >= min_puan]\n\n<span class="cm"># pipe() ile i\u015flemleri temiz bir \u015fekilde zincirleyin</span>\nsonuc = (df\n    .<span class="fn">pipe</span>(not_ekle)\n    .<span class="fn">pipe</span>(gecenleri_filtrele, min_puan=<span class="num">75</span>)\n    .<span class="fn">sort_values</span>(<span class="str">"puan"</span>, ascending=<span class="kw">False</span>)\n)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="code-wrap"><div class="code-label"><span>PYTHON</span><button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(this.closest(\'.code-wrap\').querySelector(\'code\').textContent)">COPY</button></div><pre class="code-block"><code><span class="cm"># eval() \u2014 y\u00fcksek performansl\u0131 s\u00fctun i\u015flemleri</span>\n<span class="cm"># Dize ifadelerini numexpr motoru kullanarak verimli de\u011ferlendirir</span>\n\ndf = pd.<span class="fn">DataFrame</span>({\n    <span class="str">"a"</span>: np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">100000</span>),\n    <span class="str">"b"</span>: np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">100000</span>),\n    <span class="str">"c"</span>: np.random.<span class="fn">randn</span>(<span class="num">100000</span>)\n})\n\n<span class="cm"># Standart: 2 ara dizi olu\u015fturur</span>\nsonuc = df[<span class="str">"a"</span>] + df[<span class="str">"b"</span>] * df[<span class="str">"c"</span>]\n\n<span class="cm"># eval(): tek ge\u00e7i\u015f, daha az bellek</span>\nsonuc = df.<span class="fn">eval</span>(<span class="str">"a + b * c"</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># eval ile yeni s\u00fctun olu\u015ftur</span>\ndf.<span class="fn">eval</span>(<span class="str">"d = a + b * c"</span>, inplace=<span class="kw">True</span>)\n\n<span class="cm"># Tam hat i\u00e7in query ile birle\u015ftir</span>\nsonuc = df.<span class="fn">eval</span>(<span class="str">"oran = a / (b + 1)"</span>).<span class="fn">query</span>(<span class="str">"oran > 0.5"</span>)</code></pre></div>'

+ '<div class="calc-steps">'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">1</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck DataFrame\'ler (&lt; 10K sat\u0131r)</div><div class="step-detail">Standart k\u00f6\u015feli parantez indeksleme ve boolean maskeler kullan\u0131n. Bu \u00f6l\u00e7ekte <code>.query()</code> ve <code>.eval()</code>\'un ek y\u00fck\u00fc buna de\u011fmez. Okunabilirlik mikro optimizasyondan daha \u00f6nemlidir.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">2</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">Orta DataFrame\'ler (10K\u2013100K sat\u0131r)</div><div class="step-detail">Karma\u015f\u0131k boolean ko\u015fullar i\u00e7in <code>.query()</code> kullan\u0131n (ara boolean dizilerinden ka\u00e7\u0131n\u0131r). String i\u015flemleri i\u00e7in <code>.apply()</code> yerine vekt\u00f6rize <code>.str</code> metotlar\u0131 kullan\u0131n.</div></div></div>'
+ '<div class="calc-step"><div class="step-num">3</div><div class="step-content"><div class="step-title">B\u00fcy\u00fck DataFrame\'ler (&gt; 100K sat\u0131r)</div><div class="step-detail">Bellek kopyalar\u0131n\u0131 azaltmak i\u00e7in s\u00fctun aritmeti\u011finde <code>.eval()</code> kullan\u0131n. Filtreleme i\u00e7in <code>.query()</code> kullan\u0131n. Belle\u011fi azaltmak i\u00e7in <code>dtype</code> optimizasyonunu (category, int8/16) d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcn. <code>%%timeit</code> ile profil \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131n.</div></div></div>'
+ '</div>'

+ '<div class="calc-example"><div class="example-label">SE\u00c7\u0130M KOPYA KA\u011eIDI</div><div class="example-body">'
+ '<strong>S\u00fctun:</strong> <code>df["s\u00fctun"]</code> (Series) | <code>df[["a","b"]]</code> (DataFrame) | <code>df.filter(regex="...")</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Etiketle sat\u0131r:</strong> <code>df.loc["sat\u0131r"]</code> | <code>df.loc["a":"c"]</code> (dahil)<br>'
+ '<strong>Konumla sat\u0131r:</strong> <code>df.iloc[0]</code> | <code>df.iloc[0:3]</code> (hari\u00e7)<br>'
+ '<strong>Boolean:</strong> <code>df[df["s\u00fctun"] > de\u011fer]</code> | <code>df.query("s\u00fctun > de\u011fer")</code><br>'
+ '<strong>H\u0131zl\u0131 skaler:</strong> <code>df.at["sat\u0131r","s\u00fctun"]</code> | <code>df.iat[0,0]</code><br>'
+ '<strong>String:</strong> <code>df["s\u00fctun"].str.contains("...")</code> | <code>df["s\u00fctun"].str.extract(r"...")</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Ko\u015fullu:</strong> <code>df["s\u00fctun"].where(ko\u015ful)</code> | <code>df["s\u00fctun"].mask(ko\u015ful)</code> | <code>df["s\u00fctun"].clip(alt,\u00fcst)</code><br>'
+ '<strong>Rastgele:</strong> <code>df.sample(n=k)</code> | <code>df.sample(frac=0.5)</code>'
+ '</div></div>'

